<title>USA: Financial Industries sets 5-for-1 split.</title>
<headline>Financial Industries sets 5-for-1 split.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Texas 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Industries Corp said Tuesday it split its common stock five-for-one.</p>
<p>The split is effective Tuesday for holders of record as of Tuesday.</p>
<p>The move increases the company's common stock to 10 million shares from 3,304,200 shares, the company said.</p>
<p>The company said the split was approved by its board in September and approval from shareholders came today.</p>
<p>Financial Industries Corp is an insurance and real estate holding company.</p>
